<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading Molnday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 1.12 to 6346.91.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.12 to 389.90.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.01.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1212 to 1151.</p>
<p>Volume was 388,044,050, compared with 526,623,290 Friday.</p>
